      "created_at": "2014-03-18T13:56:16.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>No Offence but i feel like this list would further confuse new players. The old standby I use is to have them pick a level 1 complexity hero, see what they did or didnt like about the hero, and then suggest to them who t otry next based on this. It also helps to have one person set up and another person help the new player.</p>",
